      "widgets_values": [
        "## Biblioteca de instruções (PT → EN)\n\nSempre termine com `isolated on a plain white background, same art style`. Peça **uma** peça por vez e diga o que NÃO deve aparecer.\n\n| quero | INSTRUÇÃO |\n|---|---|\n| **pose A** (corpo inteiro) | `Change this character to an A-pose: standing straight, arms spread apart at 45 degrees away from the body, palms facing forward, legs slightly apart, facing the camera, front view, full body, no props, no weapons, symmetrical, isolated on a plain white background, same art style, same outfit, same face` |\n| **pose T** (corpo inteiro) | `Change this character to a T-pose: standing straight, arms fully extended horizontally to the sides at shoulder height, palms facing down, legs slightly apart, facing the camera, front view, full body, no props, symmetrical, isolated on a plain white background, same art style, same outfit, same face` |\n| pose A/T — costas e lados | mesma frase trocando `front view` → `back view` / `left side view` / `right side view` + `orthographic, same scale, same framing` (gera direto as 4 vistas do `Lia_Pixal3D_MultiView`) |\n| mão aberta | `Show only this character's open right hand, palm facing the camera, fingers spread, exactly five fingers, anatomically correct, isolated on a plain white background, same art style, same skin tone, no other body parts` |\n| mão fechada | `Show only this character's closed fist, back of the hand facing the camera, …` |\n| cabeça sem cabelo | `Show only this character's bald head and neck, no hair, front view, same face, same eyes, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| só o cabelo | `Show only this character's hairstyle as a separate object floating, no head, no face, no body, front view, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| roupa / torso | `Show only the outfit worn by this character as if on an invisible mannequin, no skin, no head, front view, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| botas / sapatos | `Show only this character's boots, pair side by side, front view, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| acessório (X) | `Show only this character's [X], centered, large, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n| corpo sem roupa (base mesh) | `Show this character wearing a plain skin-tight grey bodysuit, A-pose, arms spread, front view, no accessories, isolated on a plain white background, same art style` |\n\n**Vistas para o Pixal3D MV**: repita a mesma instrução trocando só `front view` → `left side view` / `back view` / `right side view`, e acrescente `orthographic, same scale, same framing`. Salve como `<peça>_front/left/back/right.png`.\n\n**Anti-deformação no positivo** (vale em CFG 1): acrescente conforme a peça — mãos: `exactly five fingers, anatomically correct hand`; corpo: `symmetrical, correct proportions, two arms, two legs`; cabeça: `symmetrical face, two eyes`. Fica **uma** peça por imagem: `single object, centered, nothing else`.\n\n**Ordem recomendada**: 1) gere a Lia em **pose A** frente (+ costas/lados) → é a referência limpa para tudo; 2) troque o `LoadImage` para essa pose A; 3) então peça as peças.\n\n**Se a peça sair redesenhada** (cor/forma diferente): encurte a instrução, tire adjetivos, gere mais seeds. Se ainda assim variar, use `Show only … exactly as drawn in the reference`.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Instruções prontas",
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    },
