        "## Modelos (≈ 9,9 GB novos; BiRefNet já está no Drive)\n\n| arquivo | pasta | tamanho | fonte | licença |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors` | `diffusion_models/` | 4,08 GB | black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8 | **Apache-2.0** |\n| `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors` | `text_encoders/` | 5,63 GB | Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo | Apache-2.0 |\n| `flux2-vae.safetensors` | `vae/` | 0,34 GB | Comfy-Org/flux2-dev | Apache-2.0 (VAE do Klein 4B) |\n| `birefnet.safetensors` | `background_removal/` | 0,44 GB | Comfy-Org/BiRefNet | MIT |\n\nSó nós do core (Flux.2 nativo no ComfyUI ≥ 0.4.x / jan-2026). Nada de custom node. O Klein **9B** e a *Separation LoRA* do vídeo do PixelArtistry ficaram de fora de propósito: licença FLUX Non-Commercial e ~19 GB.\n"
